  "description": "About the Opportunity Tired of trying to build the next unicorn startup? Good. Welcome to Bad Ideas Only , hosted by Hoollow.This is a satirical, 100% online pitch competition where your only goal is to invent the absolute worst, most over-engineered, and utterly useless tech product possible. We don't want real solutions; we want chaotic system architectures, terrible business models, and AI-generated mockups for a problem that doesn't exist.No manual coding is required. Bring your best prompt engineering skills, generate a hilarious pitch deck, and sell your terrible idea to our panel of \"investors\" with absolute, deadpan confidence.Join Whatsapp Community: https://chat.whatsapp.com/DMNaKoEnIpY1dEjX3Tx1hS Stages and Timelines Round 1: The Pitch Deck Submission (Online) Brainstorm your useless tech product with your team. Generate your absurd business plan. Submit your idea as a presentation through the Unstop portal. Round 2: The \"Shark Tank\" Showdown (Live Pitch & Q&A) The Top 10 shortlisted teams from Round 1 will be invited to our live online stage (via Zoom/Google Meet). You will pitch your terrible startup live, followed by a hilarious and ruthless cross-questioning Q&A session from our panel and the live audience. Rule: You must maintain character and defend your chaotic tech stack as if it is a brilliant billion-dollar idea. The Final Result From the Top 10 live pitches, the judges will crown the Top 3 ultimate winners based on the absurdity of the architecture, the humor of the pitch, and the creative use of AI. Rules & Guidelines Team Size: 1 to 4 members. Zero Coding Required: This is an ideation and presentation event. You only need to build the pitch deck. Prizes & Perks Top 3 Winners: Will Announced Soon.... Guaranteed Certification: A verified Participation Certificate will be provided to all participants who successfully submit a deck in Round 1.",
