    "details": "<div class=\"container\">\n<div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_e32c88d236252946\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"0\"><strong class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">About the Opportunity</strong></p>\nTired of trying to build the next unicorn startup? Good. Welcome to <strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">Bad Ideas Only</strong>, hosted by Hoollow.This is a satirical, 100% online pitch competition where your only goal is to invent the absolute worst, most over-engineered, and utterly useless tech product possible. We don't want real solutions; we want chaotic system architectures, terrible business models, and AI-generated mockups for a problem that doesn't exist.No manual coding is required. Bring your best prompt engineering skills, generate a hilarious pitch deck, and sell your terrible idea to our panel of \"investors\" with absolute, deadpan confidence.Join Whatsapp Community:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/DMNaKoEnIpY1dEjX3Tx1hS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>https://chat.whatsapp.com/DMNaKoEnIpY1dEjX3Tx1hS</strong></a><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stages and Timelines</strong><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Round 1: The Pitch Deck Submission (Online)</strong>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li>Brainstorm your useless tech product with your team.</li>\n<li>Generate your absurd business plan.</li>\n<li>Submit your idea as a presentation through the Unstop portal.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Round 2: The \"Shark Tank\" Showdown (Live Pitch &amp; Q&amp;A)</strong>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>The <strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">Top 10</strong> shortlisted teams from Round 1 will be invited to our live online stage (via Zoom/Google Meet).</li>\n<li>You will pitch your terrible startup live, followed by a hilarious and ruthless cross-questioning Q&amp;A session from our panel and the live audience.</li>\n<li><em data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rule:</em> You must maintain character and defend your chaotic tech stack as if it is a brilliant billion-dollar idea.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Final Result</strong>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>From the Top 10 live pitches, the judges will crown the <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"56\">Top 3</strong> ultimate winners based on the absurdity of the architecture, the humor of the pitch, and the creative use of AI.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rules &amp; Guidelines</strong>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Team Size:</strong> 1 to 4 members.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Zero Coding Required:</strong> This is an ideation and presentation event. You only need to build the pitch deck.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Prizes &amp; Perks</strong>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"14\">\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Top 3 Winners:</strong> Will Announced Soon....</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Guaranteed Certification:</strong> A verified Participation Certificate will be provided to <strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">all</strong> participants who successfully submit a deck in Round 1.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
